\par\par \b \uc2  FACTBOX-Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 441 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 2001\par 08:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 19 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Ministry, worried about an export-crippling rise in the value of the yen, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market again Wednesday, buying dollars for yen. \par \par \uc2  It was the second time this week that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the market following Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was the first since April 2000. Dealers said it appeared that at least some of Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "unsterilised" \par \par \uc2  The following explains sterilised and unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and looks at the policy significance of each. \par \par \uc2  UNSTERILISED AND STERILISED \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  - In sterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the BOJ absorbs all the yen funds transferred to the banking system from the public sector as a result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , for example by selling fixed income securities. \par \par \uc2  - Sterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a net neutral impact on interest rates. \par \par \uc2  - In unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the BOJ leaves the extra yen funds in the money market caused by its yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  - Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  creates a surplus in the money market and increases downward pressure on interest rates. \par \par \uc2  POLICY IMPLICATIONS \par \par \uc2  - Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can stir financial markets as it can be taken as a signal the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is loosening credit. \par \par \uc2  - However, overall money market conditions of the day must be taken into account - whether the market is in surplus or deficit before the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related funds come into the system. The market conditions are affected by the following three main factors. \par \par \uc2  A. Transactions between the government and the private sector, such as salary for civil servants or tax payments. \par \par \uc2  B. Net funds redeemed to or drawn down from the market as a result of maturing money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  the BOJ had conducted in the past or fresh \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  made on the day. \par \par \uc2  C. Bank note issuance. \par \par \uc2  CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE \par \par \uc2  - The BOJ's policy stance in recent months has been measured by the level of current account deposits financial institutions hold at the BOJ. \par \par \uc2  - Extra balance in these non-interest-bearing accounts represents surplus funds for the banking sector, which under normal economic growth conditions would be used as additional reserves against which banks extend extra loans. \par \par \uc2  - Because the BOJ didn't absorb extra yen funds from Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the current account balance rose to 9.5 trillion yen on Wednesday, up from around eight trillion yen over the past week or so. \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions are settled in two business days. \par \par \uc2  - The BOJ, as part of a monetary easing package on Tuesday, raised its target for the current account balance to "more than" six trillion yen ($51.16 billion) from a previous target of "around" six trillion. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010919dx9j006yi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
