\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2-BOJ says uses 'unsterilised'  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Yuko Yoshikawa \par \uc2 407 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2001\par 09:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Sept 17 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) said on Monday it will provide ample liquidity to the money market including funds from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , signalling the use of so-called "unsterilised" \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  means the BOJ refrains from draining yen funds supplied to the market created through yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , thus allowing the yen to weaken further. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has never openly stated whether it sterilises or unsterilises dollar-buying, yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The Bank of Japan will provide ample liquidity, using funds including those from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to ensure smooth settlement and stability in financial markets," a BOJ spokesman said. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ has, since the terror attacks in the United States, provided funds more amply through its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  "In daily money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we decide on the total amount of fund injections, including funds for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to meet the policy directive of that particular time." \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has set the target for current account deposits at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six trillion yen ($51 billion). \par \par \uc2  But in the wake of the Tuesday's attacks in the United States, the BOJ has kept current account deposits near eight trillion yen to provide ample liquidity and prevent markets from seizing up. \par \par \uc2  Masayuki Ebira, associate director, Barclays Bank Plc in Tokyo, said: "The BOJ is just explaining what they have been doing." \par \par \uc2  Money market operators said it did not matter whether the BOJ unsterilises \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  because that is among the many tools in its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  to provide funds. \par \par \uc2  Singling out \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a way to gauge the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary stance is fruitless as well as misleading, they added. \par \par \uc2  "Unsterilised \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  simply increases government payments to the market. There are lots of other factors that affect the overall surplus of the market," Barclay's Ebira said. \par \par \uc2  The magnitude of BOJ's policy easing can be gauged only through the amount of current account deposits they disclose at the end of the day, and a rise in the surplus may or may not have occurred from funds stemming from \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar briefly rose above 118.00 yen from seven-month lows below 117 yen, after the BOJ - under instruction from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  - bought dollars for yen on Monday to halt a rapid yen rise. (Additional reporting by Yoshiko Mori). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010917dx9h00a6r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
